---
import { artist } from '../data/artist';
---
<section class="artist-discovery section" aria-labelledby="discovery-title">
 <div class="discovery-heading"><span>ASCOLTO / BOOKING</span><h2 id="discovery-title">Hai una serata in mente?</h2></div>
 <div class="discovery-answers">
  <details><summary>Chi è KIST?</summary><p>KIST è una DJ di origini lucane che vive il suo percorso musicale a Bologna. Si forma alla Link Academy e muove i primi passi nella scena al Link Club.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Che musica suona?</summary><p>Breakbeat, UK garage, funky, jungle e drum and bass, con note di acid techno. I suoi set attraversano e contaminano i generi, cercando una connessione diretta con il dance floor.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Dove posso ascoltare un set?</summary><p>Le selezioni sono nella sezione <a href="#sound">Sound</a> e sul suo <a href={artist.soundcloud} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">profilo SoundCloud</a>. Puoi anche guardare la sessione completa <a href="/sessioni/plug-radio/">KIST per Plug Radio</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Come propongo un DJ set o una collaborazione?</summary><p>Scrivi a <a href={artist.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@thats_kist su Instagram</a>, indicando data, città, luogo e idea della serata. Per conoscere le date pubblicate, consulta <a href="#diary">Notti</a>.</p></details>
 </div>
</section>
<style>
 .artist-discovery{position:relative;padding-block:64px;background:#090b1740;border-top:1px solid #bba0e821}
 .discovery-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;max-width:1250px;margin:0 auto 30px}
 .discovery-heading>span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#b3a4cd;white-space:nowrap}
 .discovery-heading h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0;line-height:1.15}
 .discovery-answers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start;gap:0 38px;max-width:1250px;margin:auto}
 details{min-width:0;border-top:1px solid #bba0e82b}
 summary{position:relative;min-height:62px;padding:20px 28px 20px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;list-style:none}
 summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
 summary:after{content:'+';position:absolute;right:2px;top:19px;color:#c9ff52;font-size:19px;line-height:1.2}
 details[open] summary:after{content:'−'}
 summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c9ff52;outline-offset:3px}
 details p{max-width:58ch;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#c9c2d9;margin:0 0 26px}
 details a{color:#e9e6f3;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#c9ff5260;text-underline-offset:4px}
 details a:hover{color:#c9ff52}
 @media(max-width:800px){.artist-discovery{padding:44px 20px}.discovery-heading{display:block;margin-bottom:22px}.discovery-heading>span{display:block;margin-bottom:14px}.discovery-answers{grid-template-columns:1fr}summary{min-height:60px;font-size:14px}details p{font-size:14px}}
</style>
